OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder inquiry after
OL,4,Awoman found on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attempted murder investigation has
OL,7,Fbeen launched after a woman in her 80s
OL,8,Fwas found on fire at a block of flats.
OL,10,FHertfordshire Police was called at
OL,11,Fabout 12:45 GMT on Monday to reports
OL,12,Fthat the woman had been found in a
OL,13,Ffirst-floor communal area in Caractacus
OL,14,FCottage View in Watford.
OL,16,FShe was taken to hospital with
OL,17,F"significant" injuries and remains in a
OL,18,Fcritical condition.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
