OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder inquiry after
OL,4,Awoman found on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Adam Bridges said detectives
OL,7,Fwere "working at pace to establish how
OL,8,Fthe woman came to sustain her
OL,9,Finjuries".
